<title>INDONESIA: Semen Cibinong H1 net edges up.</title>
<headline>Semen Cibinong H1 net edges up.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>		 (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				48.73 vs 40.09</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (in rupiah)	297 vs 244</p>
<p>    Net sales				350.19 vs 313.38</p>
<p>    Operating profit			86.29 vs 85.84</p>
<p>    Retained earnings		    284.44 vs 224.82</p>
<p>Note: PT Semen Cibinong is among Indonesia's largest cement firms.</p>
</text>
